            <div xml:id="d23">

                <pb facs="0108" n="80" xml:id="pg80"/>

                <head>23. Memorandum From the Chairman of the Interdepartmental Regional Group for
                    European Affairs (Leddy) to
                    the Under Secretary of State (Katzenbach)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d23-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1968-10-01">October 1, 1968</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Material for Use in the SIG Meeting,
                        October 4, Concerning Contingency Planning in Europe</item>
                </list>
                <p>The attached papers review the issues confronting us in Europe as a result of the
                    Czechoslovak affair with particular reference to Rumania, Yugoslavia, Austria,
                    and Berlin. The papers have been prepared for use by the SIG members in their review of status of contingency planning in
                    the aftermath of the Czech crisis.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d23-f2"/>
                </p>






                <xi:include href="d23-a1.xml" xpointer="d23-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d23-a2.xml" xpointer="d23-a2"/>
                <xi:include href="d23-a3.xml" xpointer="d23-a3"/>
                <xi:include href="d23-a4.xml" xpointer="d23-a4"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d23-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d23-f1-content">
